{"repo": {"timestamp": 1794644441000, "version": 20002, "name": "Forkray", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://acidefluorhydrique.github.io/v2rayNG/repo", "description": "Forkray, a fork of v2rayNG, compiled from source on GitHub Actions. Every release publishes a build manifest with the exact sources, toolchain and checksums, so it can be rebuilt and compared. Source: https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG", "mirrors": ["https://lanticy.codeberg.page/forkray-fdroid/fdroid/repo", "https://ray.arielx.is-a.dev/fdroid/repo", "https://hydrofluoricacid.gitlab.io/forkray-fdroid/fdroid/repo", "https://gitlab.com/HydrofluoricAcid/forkray-fdroid/-/raw/pages/fdroid/repo", "https://lanticy.itcouldbewor.se/forkray-fdroid/fdroid/repo", "https://0xacab.org/lanticy/forkray-fdroid/-/raw/pages/fdroid/repo", "https://forkray.is-my.app/fdroid/repo"]}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"authorName": "AcideFluorhydrique (fork of v2rayNG by 2dust)", "categories": ["Internet"], "changelog": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG/releases", "suggestedVersionCode": "5075504", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG/issues", "license": "GPL-3.0-only", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG", "added": 1794644437000, "packageName": "io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng", "lastUpdated": 1794644440000, "localized": {"en-US": {"description": "Forkray is a fork of <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG\">v2rayNG</a>, the V2Ray client for Android, supporting <a href=\"https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core\">Xray core</a>. It follows every upstream v2rayNG release and keeps its features and settings.\n\n<b>How it differs from v2rayNG</b><ul><li>Built entirely from source on public CI, including the Xray core, which upstream downloads as a prebuilt library. Every release publishes the exact sources, toolchain and checksums used, so it can be rebuilt and compared byte for byte.</li><li>Its own application ID, so it installs alongside v2rayNG rather than replacing it.</li><li>No in-app update check (your F-Droid client handles updates) and no promotion link.</li><li>Never switches to a direct connection silently. v2rayNG fetches subscriptions and other data directly, from your real IP address, whenever the proxy fails, even in the background. Forkray skips background updates while disconnected, tells you when it has to connect directly, and asks before retrying without the proxy.</li><li>Routing databases built from freely licensed sources in <a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/forkray-geodata\">forkray-geodata</a>, instead of prebuilt downloads.</li></ul>\n<b>Geoip and Geosite</b><ul><li>The bundled geoip.dat and geosite.dat come from v2fly/domain-list-community, gfwlist, china-operator-ip, DB-IP Lite and the address ranges operators publish. IP Geolocation by <a href=\"https://db-ip.com\">DB-IP</a>.</li><li>They are in <tt>Android/data/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/files/assets</tt> (the path may differ on some devices).</li><li>The download feature fetches the larger lists from <a href=\"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat\">Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat</a> instead, through your proxy when it is running.</li></ul>\nSource code and issues: <a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG\">github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG</a>. Documentation for the shared features: the <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG/wiki\">v2rayNG wiki</a>.\n", "featureGraphic": "featureGraphic_8IPavUGHfo1TZJe21NBtSDMiVgpOLKVfKz2BvuSTN3U=.png", "icon": "icon_kFtIabCgYycIITX2W4xk8PqBG0pviBhIQlrbpzuTBk0=.png", "name": "Forkray", "phoneScreenshots": ["1.jpg", "2.jpg", "3.jpg", "4.jpg", "5.jpg"], "summary": "A V2Ray client for Android, forked from v2rayNG and built from source"}, "zh-CN": {"description": "Forkray \u662f <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG\">v2rayNG</a> \u7684\u5206\u652f\u3002v2rayNG \u662f Android \u4e0a\u7684 V2Ray \u5ba2\u6237\u7aef\uff0c\u652f\u6301 <a href=\"https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core\">Xray \u5185\u6838</a>\u3002Forkray \u8ddf\u8fdb\u4e0a\u6e38 v2rayNG \u7684\u6bcf\u4e00\u4e2a\u7248\u672c\uff0c\u4fdd\u7559\u5176\u5168\u90e8\u529f\u80fd\u548c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u3002\n\n<b>\u4e0e v2rayNG \u7684\u533a\u522b</b><ul><li>\u5168\u90e8\u5728\u516c\u5f00\u7684 CI \u4e0a\u4ece\u6e90\u4ee3\u7801\u6784\u5efa\uff0c\u5305\u62ec\u4e0a\u6e38\u4ee5\u9884\u7f16\u8bd1\u5e93\u5f62\u5f0f\u4e0b\u8f7d\u7684 Xray \u5185\u6838\u3002\u6bcf\u4e2a\u7248\u672c\u90fd\u4f1a\u516c\u5e03\u6240\u7528\u7684\u786e\u5207\u6e90\u4ee3\u7801\u3001\u5de5\u5177\u94fe\u548c\u6821\u9a8c\u548c\uff0c\u4efb\u4f55\u4eba\u90fd\u53ef\u4ee5\u91cd\u65b0\u6784\u5efa\u5e76\u9010\u5b57\u8282\u6bd4\u5bf9\u3002</li><li>\u4f7f\u7528\u72ec\u7acb\u7684\u5e94\u7528 ID\uff0c\u53ef\u4ee5\u4e0e v2rayNG \u540c\u65f6\u5b89\u88c5\uff0c\u4e0d\u4f1a\u66ff\u6362\u5b83\u3002</li><li>\u6ca1\u6709\u5e94\u7528\u5185\u66f4\u65b0\u68c0\u67e5\uff08\u7531 F-Droid \u5ba2\u6237\u7aef\u8d1f\u8d23\u66f4\u65b0\uff09\uff0c\u4e5f\u6ca1\u6709\u63a8\u5e7f\u94fe\u63a5\u3002</li><li>\u7edd\u4e0d\u6084\u6084\u6539\u4e3a\u76f4\u8fde\u3002\u4ee3\u7406\u5931\u8d25\u65f6\uff0cv2rayNG \u4f1a\u76f4\u63a5\u7528\u4f60\u7684\u771f\u5b9e IP \u83b7\u53d6\u8ba2\u9605\u7b49\u6570\u636e\uff0c\u5373\u4f7f\u5728\u540e\u53f0\u4e5f\u662f\u5982\u6b64\u3002Forkray \u5728\u672a\u8fde\u63a5\u65f6\u8df3\u8fc7\u540e\u53f0\u66f4\u65b0\uff0c\u9700\u8981\u76f4\u8fde\u65f6\u4f1a\u544a\u8bc9\u4f60\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u4e0d\u7ecf\u4ee3\u7406\u91cd\u8bd5\u4e4b\u524d\u5148\u5f81\u6c42\u4f60\u7684\u540c\u610f\u3002</li><li>\u8def\u7531\u6570\u636e\u5e93\u7531 <a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/forkray-geodata\">forkray-geodata</a> \u4e2d\u91c7\u7528\u81ea\u7531\u8bb8\u53ef\u7684\u6765\u6e90\u6784\u5efa\uff0c\u800c\u4e0d\u662f\u4e0b\u8f7d\u9884\u7f16\u8bd1\u6587\u4ef6\u3002</li></ul>\n<b>Geoip \u4e0e Geosite</b><ul><li>\u5185\u7f6e\u7684 geoip.dat \u548c geosite.dat \u6765\u81ea v2fly/domain-list-community\u3001gfwlist\u3001china-operator-ip\u3001DB-IP Lite \u4ee5\u53ca\u5404\u8fd0\u8425\u5546\u516c\u5e03\u7684\u5730\u5740\u6bb5\u3002IP Geolocation by <a href=\"https://db-ip.com\">DB-IP</a>.</li><li>\u5b83\u4eec\u4f4d\u4e8e <tt>Android/data/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/files/assets</tt>\uff08\u90e8\u5206\u8bbe\u5907\u4e0a\u8def\u5f84\u53ef\u80fd\u4e0d\u540c\uff09\u3002</li><li>\u4e0b\u8f7d\u529f\u80fd\u4f1a\u6539\u4ece <a href=\"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat\">Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat</a> \u83b7\u53d6\u66f4\u5927\u7684\u89c4\u5219\u5217\u8868\uff1b\u4ee3\u7406\u8fd0\u884c\u65f6\u7ecf\u7531\u4ee3\u7406\u4e0b\u8f7d\u3002</li></ul>\n\u6e90\u4ee3\u7801\u4e0e\u95ee\u9898\u53cd\u9988\uff1a<a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG\">github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG</a>\u3002\u5171\u6709\u529f\u80fd\u7684\u6587\u6863\u8bf7\u53c2\u9605 <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG/wiki\">v2rayNG wiki</a>\u3002\n", "name": "Forkray", "summary": "Android \u4e0a\u7684 V2Ray \u5ba2\u6237\u7aef\uff0c\u5206\u652f\u81ea v2rayNG\uff0c\u4ece\u6e90\u4ee3\u7801\u6784\u5efa"}, "zh-TW": {"description": "Forkray \u662f <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG\">v2rayNG</a> \u7684\u5206\u652f\u3002v2rayNG \u662f Android \u4e0a\u7684 V2Ray \u7528\u6236\u7aef\uff0c\u652f\u63f4 <a href=\"https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core\">Xray \u6838\u5fc3</a>\u3002Forkray \u8ddf\u9032\u4e0a\u6e38 v2rayNG \u7684\u6bcf\u4e00\u500b\u7248\u672c\uff0c\u4fdd\u7559\u5176\u6240\u6709\u529f\u80fd\u8207\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3002\n\n<b>\u8207 v2rayNG \u7684\u5dee\u7570</b><ul><li>\u5b8c\u5168\u5728\u516c\u958b\u7684 CI \u4e0a\u5f9e\u539f\u59cb\u78bc\u5efa\u7f6e\uff0c\u5305\u62ec\u4e0a\u6e38\u4ee5\u9810\u5148\u7de8\u8b6f\u7684\u7a0b\u5f0f\u5eab\u5f62\u5f0f\u4e0b\u8f09\u7684 Xray \u6838\u5fc3\u3002\u6bcf\u500b\u7248\u672c\u90fd\u6703\u516c\u958b\u6240\u7528\u7684\u78ba\u5207\u539f\u59cb\u78bc\u3001\u5de5\u5177\u93c8\u8207\u6821\u9a57\u78bc\uff0c\u4efb\u4f55\u4eba\u90fd\u80fd\u91cd\u65b0\u5efa\u7f6e\u4e26\u9010\u4f4d\u5143\u7d44\u6bd4\u5c0d\u3002</li><li>\u4f7f\u7528\u7368\u7acb\u7684\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f ID\uff0c\u53ef\u8207 v2rayNG \u540c\u6642\u5b89\u88dd\uff0c\u4e0d\u6703\u53d6\u4ee3\u5b83\u3002</li><li>\u6c92\u6709\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f\u5167\u7684\u66f4\u65b0\u6aa2\u67e5\uff08\u7531 F-Droid \u7528\u6236\u7aef\u8ca0\u8cac\u66f4\u65b0\uff09\uff0c\u4e5f\u6c92\u6709\u63a8\u5ee3\u9023\u7d50\u3002</li><li>\u7d55\u4e0d\u9ed8\u9ed8\u6539\u70ba\u76f4\u63a5\u9023\u7dda\u3002\u4ee3\u7406\u5931\u6557\u6642\uff0cv2rayNG \u6703\u76f4\u63a5\u4ee5\u4f60\u7684\u771f\u5be6 IP \u53d6\u5f97\u8a02\u95b1\u7b49\u8cc7\u6599\uff0c\u5373\u4f7f\u5728\u80cc\u666f\u4e5f\u662f\u5982\u6b64\u3002Forkray \u5728\u672a\u9023\u7dda\u6642\u7565\u904e\u80cc\u666f\u66f4\u65b0\uff0c\u9700\u8981\u76f4\u63a5\u9023\u7dda\u6642\u6703\u544a\u8a34\u4f60\uff0c\u4e26\u5728\u4e0d\u7d93\u4ee3\u7406\u91cd\u8a66\u4e4b\u524d\u5148\u5fb5\u6c42\u4f60\u7684\u540c\u610f\u3002</li><li>\u8def\u7531\u8cc7\u6599\u5eab\u7531 <a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/forkray-geodata\">forkray-geodata</a> \u4e2d\u63a1\u7528\u81ea\u7531\u6388\u6b0a\u7684\u4f86\u6e90\u5efa\u7f6e\uff0c\u800c\u975e\u4e0b\u8f09\u9810\u5148\u7de8\u8b6f\u7684\u6a94\u6848\u3002</li></ul>\n<b>Geoip \u8207 Geosite</b><ul><li>\u5167\u5efa\u7684 geoip.dat \u8207 geosite.dat \u4f86\u81ea v2fly/domain-list-community\u3001gfwlist\u3001china-operator-ip\u3001DB-IP Lite \u4ee5\u53ca\u5404\u96fb\u4fe1\u696d\u8005\u516c\u5e03\u7684\u4f4d\u5740\u7bc4\u570d\u3002IP Geolocation by <a href=\"https://db-ip.com\">DB-IP</a>.</li><li>\u5b83\u5011\u4f4d\u65bc <tt>Android/data/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/files/assets</tt>\uff08\u90e8\u5206\u88dd\u7f6e\u4e0a\u7684\u8def\u5f91\u53ef\u80fd\u4e0d\u540c\uff09\u3002</li><li>\u4e0b\u8f09\u529f\u80fd\u6703\u6539\u5f9e <a href=\"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat\">Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat</a> \u53d6\u5f97\u8f03\u5927\u7684\u898f\u5247\u6e05\u55ae\uff1b\u4ee3\u7406\u57f7\u884c\u6642\u6703\u900f\u904e\u4ee3\u7406\u4e0b\u8f09\u3002</li></ul>\n\u539f\u59cb\u78bc\u8207\u554f\u984c\u56de\u5831\uff1a<a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG\">github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG</a>\u3002\u5171\u7528\u529f\u80fd\u7684\u8aaa\u660e\u6587\u4ef6\u8acb\u53c3\u95b1 <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG/wiki\">v2rayNG wiki</a>\u3002\n", "name": "Forkray", "summary": "Android \u4e0a\u7684 V2Ray \u7528\u6236\u7aef\uff0c\u5206\u652f\u81ea v2rayNG\uff0c\u5f9e\u539f\u59cb\u78bc\u5efa\u7f6e"}}}], "packages": {"io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng": [{"added": 1794644440000, "apkName": "v2rayNG_2.3.15-fdroid_x86_64.apk", "hash": "01de85976267a9d789edd061aef8918ff0119bd4349457d14394f541dd484d2b", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 24, "nativecode": ["x86_64"], "packageName": "io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng", "sig": "1a1a05eaa045f943e4416e9dea32932c", "signer": "561d282e03be3557d09073fc317fcc2f4d3231fa26da662e290222f4b34f78d9", "size": 22491695, "targetSdkVersion": 37, "uses-permission": [["android.permission.QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE", null], ["android.permission.CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_LOCAL_NETWORK", null], ["android.permission.INTERNET", null], ["android.permission.CAMERA", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE", null], ["android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS", null], ["android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED", null], ["android.permission.WAKE_LOCK", null], ["io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION", null]], "versionCode": 5075504, "versionName": "2.3.15"}, {"added": 1794644439000, "apkName": "v2rayNG_2.3.15-fdroid_x86.apk", "hash": "a114f05614d73cd6d41b54413230848372248025e4aba66603c352a1018377ea", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 24, "nativecode": ["x86"], "packageName": "io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng", "sig": "1